---
title: Pumpkin Bread
servings: 10
time: 75 min
tags: baking, bread, pumpkin, dessert, sweet
cuisine: American
course: dessert
source: pdf786.jpg
---

Preheat oven to 350°F (175°C). Grease and flour a #loaf pan{}.

In a #large bowl{}, combine @granulated sugar{1 1/3%cups}, @butter{1/3%cup}(softened), @eggs{2}, @all-purpose flour{1 2/3%cups}, @baking powder{1/4%tsp}, @baking soda{1%tsp}, @salt{3/4%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{1/2%tsp}, @ground cloves{1/4%tsp}, @water{1/3%cup}, and @canned pumpkin{1%cup}.

Mix well until thoroughly blended and smooth.

Pour the batter into the prepared loaf pan.

Bake at 350°F for about ~{60%min} until a tester inserted in the center comes out clean.
